# The benchmark producer golden fixtures are asserted byte-for-byte against the serializer
# output, which is UTF-8 without BOM and uses LF newlines. Pin them to LF so Git's autocrlf
# setting cannot rewrite them to CRLF on checkout and break the byte-stability comparison.
benchmark/**/*.json text eol=lf

# Committed licensed-TAS transcripts are evidence, kept exactly as the harness wrote them - including
# the trailing space its fixed-width verdict lines end with. Only end-of-line blanks are exempted, and
# only for these transcripts; every other whitespace check still applies to them and to all sources.
Documentation/evidence/*.log whitespace=-blank-at-eol
